<content>
  <section><title>Self Check</title>
<para>The table below shows the number of chips in a game and the number of moves that can be made.</para>
<table>
  <tgroup cols="5"><thead/>
  <tbody>
    <row>
      <entry>Number of chips</entry>
      <entry>
        1
      </entry>
      <entry>
        2
      </entry>
      <entry>
        3
      </entry>
      <entry>
        4
      </entry>
    </row>
    <row>
      <entry>Number of possible moves</entry>
      <entry>
        3
      </entry>
      <entry>
        5
      </entry>
      <entry>
        7
      </entry>
      <entry>
        9
      </entry>
    </row>
  </tbody>
</tgroup></table>
<para>How many moves would be possible with 7 chips?</para></section>
</content>
